  "ek-b-0094": "Without presenting the prescribed documents and without the vehicle, the emission control technician may not perform the emission control.",
  "ek-b-0095": "During emission control, the emission status of a motor vehicle or the function and activities of individual systems, components or separate technical units, which affect the formation of pollutants in the vehicle's exhaust gases, are evaluated using a three-level classification.",
  "ek-b-0096": "The vehicle is evaluated according to a list of possible faults and their level of severity. Errors mean technical malfunctions and other cases of non-compliance detected during emission control, namely:",
  "ek-b-0097": "ELIGIBLE",
  "ek-b-0098": "<strong>Easy mistakes</strong>, which do not have a significant impact on the environment or on the safety and operation of the vehicle, as well as other less significant cases of non-compliance, the vehicle is FIT for operation in road traffic - the vehicle operator is obliged to remove them.",
  "ek-b-0099": "TEMPORARY ELIGIBLE",
  "ek-b-0100": "<strong>Serious mistakes</strong>, which may affect the safety of the vehicle or the environment or endanger other road users, as well as other significant cases of non-compliance, the vehicle is TEMPORARILY FIT for operation in road traffic - the vehicle operator is obliged to submit the vehicle to a repeated EC within 60 calendar days. If the same serious fault is detected again by the repeated emission control, the vehicle is unfit for operation in road traffic. If the vehicle operator does not subject the vehicle to a repeated EC within the established period, the vehicle is unfit for operation in road traffic.",
